      "prompt_hash": "e77ffad9dd5dd264",
      "draft": "Blackthorn looked from the proffered boots up to Nicco, her nearly black eyes narrowing slightly in sharp, businesslike calculation. Her round face remained composed, though a flicker of impatience touched the set of her mouth as she reached out and took the leather boots back into her own hands.\n\n\"Suit yourself,\" Blackthorn said, holding the boots by their collars. \"Good leather doesn't go to waste in the West District, and I have plenty of people who will put them to use.\" \n\nAcross the open cobbles of the square, the quiet daytime foot traffic trickled past the heavy entrance of the tower and the dingy front of The Coined Lie, leaving the trade settled between them without ceremony.",
